body: "Context: pm-web package.json advertises dist/index.d.ts, but the server tsconfig disabled declaration output. The bundled extensions/pm-graph workspace also lagged the current pm CLI and pm-changelog versions.\\n\\nScope: enable declaration output, refresh bundled graph dependency pins, regenerate locks/build artifacts, and validate release readiness."
